      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُغْنُونٌ</span></b>  The <i>sides,</i> or <i>adjacent parts,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">النَوَاحِى</span>)
<i>of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهَاة</span>, <i>impending</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشْرِفَة</span>) <i>over the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلْق</span> [or
<i>throat</i>]; as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَغَانِينٌ</span>: (JK:) see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُنْدُبَةٌ</span>, and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُغْدٌ</span>.

